{"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DeepLinkEffectHandler"},{"type":"text","text":" turns a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DeepLinkDecision"},{"type":"text","text":" into a typed execution result."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Coordinator and app-shell owners can inject an already configured"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"DeepLinkPipeline","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"init(pipeline:navigator:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The handler then becomes","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the single owner of execution and pending replay; mirror returned results into","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"observable app state only when UI state needs that projection. Live auth and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"policy state should be read by the pipeline’s closures because the handler","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retains the pipeline value supplied at initialization.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Important result shapes include:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".executed","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".executionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".applicationRejected","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".pending","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".rejected","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unhandled","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidURL","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".missingDeepLinkURL","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".noPendingDeepLink","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The handler keeps deep-link execution explicit:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it does not hide pending replay"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it does not collapse rejection into generic failure"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it validates the produced "},{"code":"NavigationPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before execution and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports "},{"code":".applicationRejected","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" when the current stack cannot apply it"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"its flow counterpart preserves the authority’s exact"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"FlowRejectionReason","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in "},{"code":".applicationRejected(plan:path:reason:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it reports "},{"code":".executionFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the full batch when middleware or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"command execution prevents every step from succeeding"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it keeps batch execution payloads visible to the caller"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it keeps exactly one pending slot, replacing older deferred links with newer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests even when their URL and plan values are equal"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it reinstalls app-owned in-memory handoffs through "},{"code":"restore(pending:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"it lets callers drop the slot explicitly via "},{"code":"clearPendingDeepLink()","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PendingDeepLink"},{"type":"text","text":" does not define a cross-launch serialization contract. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"durable pending links, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPendingDeepLinkPersistence"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowDeepLinkEffectHandler.restore(pending:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"resumePendingDeepLinkIfAllowed"},{"type":"text","text":" when auth state must be checked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asynchronously before replaying a stored plan. Its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rethrows"},{"type":"text","text":" contract accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both nonthrowing authorization checks and token refresh or session probes that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can fail before a boolean authorization decision exists."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pending replay uses request identity rather than value equality. If a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equal-valued request arrives while the authorization closure is suspended, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-flight call returns that replacement as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pending"},{"type":"text","text":"; only a later replay may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consume it."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.effects\/documentation\/InnoRou